{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十六年春正月乙丑，如長濼。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"二月庚子，夏國遣使來貢。丙午，以監門衛上將軍耶律喜羅為中臺省左相。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"三月甲子，女直遣使來貢。乙亥，鼻骨德酋長來貢。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"夏四月癸卯，振崇德宮所隸州縣民之被水者。丁未，罷民輸官俸，給自內帑。己酉，祈雨。乙卯，如木葉山。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"五月甲子，祭白馬神。丁卯，祠木葉山，告來歲南伐。庚辰，鐵驪來貢。乙酉，還上京。婦人年踰九十者賜物。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"六月戊子朔，致奠於祖、懷二陵。是月，清暑炭山。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"秋七月丁巳朔，錄囚，聽政。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"八月丁亥朔，東幸。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"九月丁巳朔，駐蹕得勝口。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"冬十一月，遣使冊高麗國王誦。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十二月丙戌朔，宋國王休哥薨，輟朝五日。進封皇弟恒王隆慶為梁國王、南京留守，鄭王隆祐為吳國王。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"是年，放進士楊又玄等二人。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十七年春正月乙卯朔，如長春宮。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"夏四月，如炭山清暑。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"六月，兀惹烏昭慶來。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"秋七月，以伐宋詔諭諸道。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"九月庚辰朔，幸南京。己亥，南伐。癸卯，射鬼箭。北院樞密使魏王耶律斜軫薨，以韓德讓兼知北院樞密使事。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_18","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"冬十月癸酉，攻遂城，不克。遣蕭繼遠攻狼山鎮石砦，破之。次瀛州，與宋軍戰，擒其將康昭裔、宋順，獲兵仗、器甲無算。進攻樂壽縣，拔之。次遂城，敵眾臨水以拒，縱騎兵突之，殺戮殆盡。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_19","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"是年，放進士初錫等四人及第。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_20","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十八年春正月，還次南京，賞有功將士，罰不用命者。詔諸軍各還本道。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_21","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"二月，幸延芳淀。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_22","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"夏四月己未，駐蹕于清泉淀。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_23","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"五月丁酉，清暑炭山。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_24","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"六月，阻卜叛酋鶻碾之弟鐵剌不率部眾來附，鶻碾無所歸，遂降，詔誅之。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_25","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"秋七月，駐蹕于湯泉。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_26","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"九月乙亥朔，駐蹕黑河。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_27","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"冬十一月甲戌朔，授西平王李繼遷子德昭朔方軍節度使。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_28","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十二月，回鶻來貢。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_29","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"是年，放進士南承保等三人及第。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_30","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十九年春正月辛巳，以祗候郎君班詳穩觀音為奚六部大王。甲申，回鶻進梵僧名醫。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_31","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"三月乙亥，夏國遣李文貴來貢。乙酉，西南面招討司奏党項捷。壬辰，皇后蕭氏以罪降為貴妃。賜大丞相韓德讓名德昌。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_32","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"夏四月乙巳，幸吳國王隆祐第視疾。丙午，問安皇太后。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_33","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"五月癸酉，清暑炭山。丙戌，冊蕭氏為齊天皇后。庚寅，以千拽剌詳穩耶律王奴為乙室大王。辛卯，以青牛白馬祭天地。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_34","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"六月乙巳，以所俘宋將康昭裔為昭順軍節度使。戊午，夏國奏下宋恒、環、慶等三州，賜詔褒之。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_35","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"秋七月丙戌，以東京統軍使耶律奴瓜為南府宰相。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_36","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"八月庚戌，達盧骨部來貢。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"九月己巳朔，問安皇太后。戊子，駐蹕昌平。庚寅，西南面招討司奏討吐谷渾捷。辛卯，幸南京。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"冬十月己亥，南伐。壬寅，次鹽溝。徙封吳國王隆祐為楚國王，留守京師。丁未，梁國王隆慶統先鋒軍以進。辛亥，射鬼箭。壬子，以青牛白馬祭天地。甲寅，遼軍與宋兵戰于遂城，敗之。庚申，以黑白羊祭天地。丙寅，次滿城，以泥淖班師。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十一月庚午，射鬼箭。丙子，宋兵出淤口、益津關來侵，偵候謀洼、虞人招古擊敗之。己卯，觀漁儒門濼。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"閏月己酉，鼻骨德來貢。己未，減關市稅。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十二月庚辰，免南京、平州租稅。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"二十年春正月庚子，如延芳淀。癸丑，東方五色虹見。詔安撫西南面向化諸部。甲寅，夏國遣使貢馬、駝。辛酉，女直宰相夷離底來貢。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"二月丁丑，女直遣其子來朝。高麗遣使賀伐宋捷。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"三月甲寅，遣北府宰相蕭繼遠等南伐。壬戌，駐蹕鴛鴦濼。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"夏四月丙寅朔，文班太保達里底敗宋兵于梁門。甲戌，南京統軍使蕭撻凜破宋軍於泰州。乙酉，南征將校獻俘，賜爵賞有差。戊子，鐵驪遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"五月乙卯，幸炭山清暑。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"六月，夏國遣劉仁勗來告下靈州。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_48","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"秋七月甲午朔，日有食之。丁酉，以邢抱朴為南院樞密使。辛丑，高麗遣使來貢本國地里圖。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_49","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"九月癸巳朔，謁顯陵，告南伐捷。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_50","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"冬十月癸亥朔，至自顯陵。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_51","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十二月，奚王府五帳六節度獻七金山土河川地，賜金幣。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_52","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"是歲，南京、平州麥秀兩岐。放進士邢祥等六人及第。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_53","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"二十一年春正月，如鴛鴦濼。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_54","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"三月壬辰，詔修日曆官毋書細事。甲午，朝皇太后。戊午，鐵驪來貢。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_55","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"夏四月乙丑，女直遣使來貢。戊辰，兀惹、渤海、奧里米、越里篤、越里吉等五部遣使來貢。是月，耶律奴瓜、蕭撻凜獲宋將王繼忠于望都。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_56","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"五月庚寅朔，清暑炭山。丁巳，西平王李繼遷薨，其子德昭遣使來告。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_57","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"六月己卯，贈繼遷尚書令，遣西上閤門使丁振弔慰。辛巳，党項來貢。乙酉，阻卜鐵剌里率諸部來降。是月，修可敦城。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_58","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"秋七月庚戌，阻卜、烏古來貢。甲寅，以奚王府監軍耶律室魯為南院大王。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_59","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"八月乙酉，阻卜鐵剌里來朝。丙戌，朝皇太后。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_60","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"九月己亥，夏國李德昭遣使來謝弔贈。癸丑，幸女河湯泉，改其名曰松林。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_61","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"冬十月丁巳朔，駐蹕七渡河。戊辰，以楚國王隆祐為西南面招討使。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_62","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十一月壬辰，故于越耶律休哥之子道士奴、高九等謀叛，伏誅。丙申，通括南院部民。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_63","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十二月癸未，罷三京諸道貢。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_64","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"二十二年春正月丁亥，如鴛鴦濼。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_65","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"二月乙卯朔，女直遣使來貢。丙寅，南院樞密使邢抱朴薨，輟朝三日。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_66","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"三月己丑，罷番部賀千齡節及冬至、重五貢。乙未，西夏李德昭遣使上繼遷遺物。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_67","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"夏四月丁卯，朝皇太后。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_68","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"五月，清暑炭山。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_69","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"六月戊午，以可敦城為鎮州，軍曰建安。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_70","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"秋七月甲申，遣使封夏國李德昭為西平王。丁亥，兀惹、蒲奴里、剖阿里、越里篤、奧里米等部來貢。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_71","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"八月丙辰，党項來貢。庚申，阻卜酋鐵剌里來朝。戊辰，鐵剌里求婚，不許。丙子，駐蹕犬牙山。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_72","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"九月己丑，以南伐諭高麗。丙午，幸南京。女直遣使獻所獲烏昭慶妻子。丁未，致祭于太宗皇帝廟。以北院大王磨魯古、太尉老君奴監北、南王府兵。庚戌，命楚國王隆祐留守京師。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_73","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"閏月己未，南伐。癸亥，次固安。以所獲諜者射鬼箭。甲子，以青牛白馬祭天地。丙寅，遼師與宋兵戰于唐興，大破之。丁卯，蕭撻凜與宋軍戰于遂城，敗之。庚午，軍于望都。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_74","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"冬十月乙酉，以黑白羊祭天地。丙戌，攻瀛州，不克。甲午，下祁州，賚降兵。以酒脯祭天地。己酉，西平王李德昭遣使謝封冊。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_75","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十一月癸亥，馬軍都指揮使耶律課里遇宋兵于洺州，擊退之。甲子，東京留守蕭排押獲宋魏府官吏田逢吉、郭守榮、常顯、劉綽等以獻。丁卯，南院大王善補奏宋遣人遺王繼忠弓矢，密請求和。詔繼忠與使會，許和。庚午，攻破德清軍。壬申，次澶淵。蕭撻凜中伏弩死。乙亥，攻破通利軍。丁丑，宋遣崇儀副使曹利用請和，即遣飛龍使韓杞持書報聘。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_76","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十二月庚辰朔，日有食之，既。癸未，宋復遣曹利用來，以無還地之意，遣監門衛大將軍姚柬之持書往報。戊子，宋遣李繼昌請和，以太后為叔母，願歲輸銀十萬兩，絹二十萬匹。許之，即遣閤門使丁振持書報聘。己丑，詔諸軍解嚴。是月，班師。皇太后賜大丞相齊王韓德昌姓耶律，徙王晉。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_77","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"是年，放進士李可封等三人。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_78","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"二十三年春正月戊午，還次南京。庚申，大饗將卒，爵賞有差。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_79","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"二月丙戌，復置榷場於振武軍。丁巳，夏國遣使告下宋青城。辛酉，朝皇太后。以惕隱化哥為南院大王，行軍都監老君奴為惕隱。乙丑，振党項部。丁卯，回鶻來貢。丁丑，改易州飛狐招安使為安撫使。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_80","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"夏四月丙戌，女直及阿薩蘭回鶻各遣使來貢。乙未，鐵驪來貢。己亥，党項來侵。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_81","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"五月戊申朔，宋遣孫僅等來賀皇太后生辰。乙卯，以金帛賜陣亡將士家。丙寅，高麗以與宋和，遣使來賀。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_82","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"六月壬辰，清暑炭山。甲午，阻卜酋鐵剌里遣使賀與宋和。己亥，達旦國九部遣使來聘。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_83","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"秋七月癸丑，問安皇太后。戊午，党項來貢。辛酉，以青牛白馬祭天地。壬戌，烏古來貢。丁卯，女直遣使來貢。阿薩蘭回鶻遣使來請先留使者，皆遣之。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_84","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"九月甲戌，遣太尉阿里、太傅楊六賀宋主生辰。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_85","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"冬十月丙子朔，鼻骨德來貢。戊子，朝皇太后。甲午，駐蹕七渡河。癸卯，宋歲幣始至，後為常。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_86","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十一月戊申，上遣太保合住、頒給使韓橁，太后遣太師盆奴、政事舍人高正使宋賀正旦。辛亥，觀漁桑乾河。丁巳，詔大丞相耶律德昌出宮籍，屬于橫帳。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_87","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十二月丙申，宋遣周漸等來賀千齡節。丁酉，復遣張若谷等來賀正旦。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_88","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"二十四年春正月，如鴛鴦濼。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_89","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"夏五月壬寅朔，幸炭山清暑。幽皇太妃胡輦于懷州，囚夫人夷懶于南京，餘黨皆生瘞之。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_90","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"秋七月辛丑朔，南幸。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_91","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"八月丙戌，改南京宮宣教門為元和，外三門為南端，左掖門為萬春，右掖門為千秋。是月，沙州燉煌王曹壽遣使進大食國馬及美玉，以對衣、銀器等物賜之。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_92","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"九月，幸南京。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_93","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"冬十月庚午朔，帝率群臣上皇太后尊號曰睿德神略應運啟化承天皇太后，群臣上皇帝尊號曰至德廣孝昭聖天輔皇帝。大赦。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_94","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"是年，放進士楊佶等二十三人及第。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_95","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"二十五年春正月，建中京。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_96","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"二月，如鴛鴦濼。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_97","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"夏四月，清暑炭山。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_98","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"六月，賜皇太妃胡輦死于幽所。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_99","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"秋七月壬申，西平王李德昭母薨，遣使弔祭。甲戌，遣使起復。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_100","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"九月，西北路招討使蕭圖玉討阻卜，破之。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_101","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"冬十月丙申，駐蹕中京。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_102","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十二月己酉，振饒州饑民。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_103","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"二十六年春二月，如長濼。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_104","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"夏四月辛卯朔，祠木葉山。","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_105","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"五月庚申朔，還上京。丙寅，高麗進龍鬚草席。己巳，遣使賀中京成。庚午，致祭祖、懷二陵。辛未，駐蹕懷州。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_106","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"秋七月，增太祖、太宗、讓國皇帝、世宗諡，仍諡皇太弟李胡曰欽順皇帝。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_107","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"冬十月戊子朔，幸中京。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_108","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十二月，蕭圖玉奏討甘州回鶻，降其王耶剌里，撫慰而還。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_109","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"是年，放進士史克忠等一十三人。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_110","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"二十七年春正月，鉤魚土河。獵于瑞鹿原。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_111","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"夏四月丙戌朔，駐蹕中京，營建宮室。庚戌，廢霸州處置司。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_112","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"秋七月甲寅朔，霖雨，潢、土、斡剌、陰涼四河皆溢，漂沒民舍。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_113","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"八月甲申，北幸。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_114","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"冬十一月壬子朔，行柴冊禮。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_115","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"十二月乙酉，南幸。皇太后不豫。戊子，肆赦。辛卯，皇太后崩于行宮。壬辰，遣使報哀于宋、夏、高麗。戊申，如中京。己酉，詔免賀千齡節。","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_14_116","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_14","textTraditional":"是歲，御前引試劉二宜等三人。","sentenceOrder":116}],"overrides":{}}